algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Finite support set S ⊆ ℕⁿ, number of variables n
Output: Sh₂(S) = {β | ∃α∈S, ∃i,j: α = β + eᵢ + eⱼ}

shadow ← ∅
for each α ∈ S:
  for i = 0,...,n-1:
    if α[i] ≥ 1:
      α' ← α - eᵢ
      for j = 0,...,n-1:
        if α'[j] ≥ 1:
          shadow ← shadow ∪ {α' - eⱼ}
return shadow

Complexity: O(|S| · n²)
